      "en": "The Luminis inward-opening niche door is a stylish and space-saving solution for the shower area. Because the door opens inward, the cabin has a clean look and no space is lost outside the shower. The horizontal handle also doubles as a practical towel hook. BRAUER offers this niche door in six finish options: chrome, matt black, brushed stainless steel, gunmetal, gold and copper.\n\n## Quality and finish\n\n- 6 mm tempered glass door with dirt- and water-repellent glass coating\n- Glass fittings and wall profile made from stainless steel with a high-quality PVD coating\n- Magnetic closure for smooth and reliable sealing\n- Glass coating can easily be refreshed when worn using the BRAUER glass coating (available separately)\n\n## Installation\n\n- Fixed with adjustable wall profiles, suitable for virtually any bathroom\n- Reversible installation: can be placed on the left or right side",
